WEBVTT

00:00:36.950 --> 00:00:38.790
Himiko.

00:00:38.790 --> 00:00:40.540
I finally found you.

00:00:40.540 --> 00:00:41.700
Iride...

00:00:41.700 --> 00:00:46.200
Here. This came as a toy
in the kid's lunch I had yesterday.

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:49.120
It's yours if you want it.

00:00:49.120 --> 00:00:51.120
Thank you very much!

00:00:52.200 --> 00:00:54.660
--By the way, Iride...
--Hmm?

00:00:54.660 --> 00:00:57.370
What happened to your cheek?

00:00:57.370 --> 00:01:01.500
Oh, this is just... Uh, I fell over.

00:01:01.500 --> 00:01:03.700
Did Kudou play a part in this?

00:01:03.700 --> 00:01:04.790
Yeah...

00:01:04.790 --> 00:01:06.200
Did you have a fight?

00:01:06.200 --> 00:01:10.540
Hmm... I wonder if you could call that a fight?

00:01:10.540 --> 00:01:13.910
I don't think he wants
to speak with me anymore.

00:01:25.290 --> 00:01:28.870
"The Ones Within"

00:02:59.200 --> 00:03:00.830
What's that?

00:03:00.830 --> 00:03:04.370
Anya? Mind if I sit next to you?

00:03:04.370 --> 00:03:07.040
--Don't.
--I-I'll even eat your peppers!

00:03:07.040 --> 00:03:08.580
No need. I'll leave 'em.

00:03:08.580 --> 00:03:10.450
You better not leave them.

00:03:11.700 --> 00:03:13.870
You better not leave them.

00:03:13.870 --> 00:03:16.500
Wh-Whoa! The hell you doing?!

00:03:16.500 --> 00:03:18.500
Don't tap my shoulder with a weapon!

00:03:18.500 --> 00:03:22.910
Those peppers were raised by farmers
with love and shipped off to enjoy.

00:03:22.910 --> 00:03:26.500
You could say they entrusted us
to take care of their babies.

00:03:26.500 --> 00:03:28.750
You better not leave them.

00:03:28.750 --> 00:03:32.290
People don't ship off their babies!

00:03:32.290 --> 00:03:33.750
Anya...

00:03:35.450 --> 00:03:38.040
What happened between you two?

00:03:38.040 --> 00:03:40.000
Well...

00:03:40.000 --> 00:03:42.290
Um...

00:03:42.290 --> 00:03:43.790
More importantly...

00:03:45.330 --> 00:03:48.500
Have you seen Kai or Zak yet today?

00:03:48.500 --> 00:03:51.950
I haven't seen either of them.

00:03:51.950 --> 00:03:53.580
I see...

00:04:02.160 --> 00:04:04.830
I knew there was no one here.

00:04:04.830 --> 00:04:08.040
It's not like they're hiding somewhere either.

00:04:12.870 --> 00:04:17.580
Are you a ghost or something?
I wish you'd stop hiding your presence.

00:04:17.580 --> 00:04:19.450
I don't mean to, but...

00:04:19.450 --> 00:04:23.000
If you're reckless again, it'll cause
more trouble for the others.

00:04:24.910 --> 00:04:28.500
So what? Have you come to lecture me?

00:04:30.410 --> 00:04:31.830
Hey!

00:04:37.830 --> 00:04:40.500
There's no one around, like I thought.

00:04:40.500 --> 00:04:43.700
It's brand new but covered in dust...

00:04:43.700 --> 00:04:46.790
An empty city made just for the game?

00:04:48.250 --> 00:04:52.750
At least we know, on the outside,
there're probably people looking for us.

00:04:52.750 --> 00:04:56.160
So what? Do you miss your family that much?

00:04:58.040 --> 00:05:00.080
I'm here for a reason.

00:05:00.080 --> 00:05:02.080
And I won't leave till I'm done.

00:05:08.870 --> 00:05:11.540
I'm searching for my twin sister.

00:05:16.250 --> 00:05:21.750
"Liver Rolling"                    "Eyeball Scooping"

00:05:29.160 --> 00:05:33.160
"Lollipops"

00:05:35.410 --> 00:05:40.120
The atmosphere here feels so different
than the other places we've been.

00:05:40.120 --> 00:05:44.040
H-Himiko, are you scared? You okay? Scared?

00:05:44.040 --> 00:05:45.120
Um, no?

00:05:45.120 --> 00:05:49.330
In that case, I'll hold your hand!
You wanna hold hands, right?!

00:05:50.910 --> 00:05:52.080
Hand sweat...

00:05:52.080 --> 00:05:53.950
No fair! I want in, too!

00:05:53.950 --> 00:05:55.290
Me, too! Me, too!

00:05:57.410 --> 00:06:01.660
Hey, you're blocking the path.
Don't spread out.

00:06:01.660 --> 00:06:05.250
Stage 5 is "Demon Extermination."

00:06:05.250 --> 00:06:10.580
Kakuriyo village here will be holding
a repose of souls festival tonight.

00:06:10.580 --> 00:06:15.870
But demons come to abduct
pure maidens during all the commotion.

00:06:15.870 --> 00:06:18.000
In order to clear this stage,

00:06:18.000 --> 00:06:23.620
you must stop the abductions and
rescue all of the captured maidens.

00:06:23.620 --> 00:06:28.410
This festival is the one event
where failure is not an option.

00:06:28.410 --> 00:06:31.250
May you all proceed with caution.

00:06:31.250 --> 00:06:34.410
Rescue? Not extermination?

00:06:34.410 --> 00:06:40.870
Of course, wiping out the whole demon
citadel is how to achieve the true end.

00:06:40.870 --> 00:06:45.080
But the demons this time are
so strong, it's almost cheating.

00:06:45.080 --> 00:06:50.750
I'm not enough of a demon myself
to give you such an impossible task.

00:06:59.370 --> 00:07:03.950
And here, we've arrived.
I will guide you no further.

00:07:03.950 --> 00:07:07.870
You can listen to the rest
of the story from the elder inside.

00:07:07.870 --> 00:07:11.250
They should be more familiar with it than I.

00:07:11.250 --> 00:07:14.290
This stage requires at least four Let's Players.

00:07:14.290 --> 00:07:18.790
There is no upper limit, but as it
will incorporate sneaking around,

00:07:18.790 --> 00:07:22.370
I do not recommend having too many people.

00:07:23.370 --> 00:07:25.290
I wish you all good luck.

00:07:28.200 --> 00:07:31.750
For now, let's all go hear
what they have to say.

00:07:36.870 --> 00:07:39.200
S-Someone go in first.

00:07:39.200 --> 00:07:40.500
Okay, I'll go!

00:07:40.500 --> 00:07:42.410
Hey, wait up! Wait up!

00:07:42.410 --> 00:07:44.620
Be a little more cautious!

00:07:45.700 --> 00:07:49.040
Didn't those two have a fight?

00:07:49.040 --> 00:07:50.660
Don't worry about it!

00:07:50.660 --> 00:07:56.040
An elder's house and king's throne
are classic starting points in RPGs!

00:07:56.040 --> 00:07:59.290
It's not like I'll get stabbed
with a knife right off the bat...

00:08:06.540 --> 00:08:10.120
Mind dropping that
dangerous weapon, Missy?

00:08:13.910 --> 00:08:15.790
A-Are you demons?

00:08:22.200 --> 00:08:24.910
I'm the village elder, Kihachi.

00:08:24.910 --> 00:08:27.790
This is my granddaughter, Kikka.

00:08:27.790 --> 00:08:30.620
She simply jumped to the wrong conclusion.

00:08:30.620 --> 00:08:31.870
It's okay.

00:08:31.870 --> 00:08:36.540
Tonight, our village is terrified
of an impending demon attack.

00:08:36.540 --> 00:08:41.580
Even I don't know if this is the night
my cute granddaughter is taken away.

00:08:41.580 --> 00:08:47.080
This senile old man would risk
his life to protect Kikka, but...

00:08:48.830 --> 00:08:50.540
Which is why, you see...

00:08:50.540 --> 00:08:54.120
"Visitors who come on the festival
night will be greeted by death."

00:08:54.120 --> 00:08:57.660
That has become the
defacto law of our village.

00:08:57.660 --> 00:09:00.040
The hell's up with your laws here?

00:09:00.040 --> 00:09:05.660
I now hear that you've come
to put an end to the demon's brutality.

00:09:05.660 --> 00:09:08.660
I don't know if this will
be of any use to you, but...

00:09:08.660 --> 00:09:12.370
...the least I can do is give
the goods in this hamper to you.

00:09:13.620 --> 00:09:17.040
I-It's really feeling like a real RPG this time!

00:09:17.040 --> 00:09:18.790
Is it treasure?! Equipment?!

00:09:18.790 --> 00:09:21.160
You guys are so dumb!

00:09:21.160 --> 00:09:23.160
Don't get so excited!

00:09:25.700 --> 00:09:27.950
"Obtained Sacrificial Robes
(One size fits all) x 2"

00:09:28.250 --> 00:09:31.870
Tellin' us to go die?!
You saying we should die instead?!

00:09:31.870 --> 00:09:34.330
Grandpa!

00:09:34.330 --> 00:09:38.580
You, give it back! Give me back my knife!

00:09:38.580 --> 00:09:42.040
Quit screwing around!
Hurry up and gimme it!

00:09:42.040 --> 00:09:44.370
I think I'm becoming butter...

00:09:44.370 --> 00:09:47.540
But isn't it an interesting idea as a plan?

00:09:47.540 --> 00:09:49.540
If we can locate the demon base,

00:09:49.540 --> 00:09:53.040
we can rescue all the
captured maidens in one go.

00:09:53.040 --> 00:09:55.330
If they're alive, that is.

00:09:55.330 --> 00:09:57.790
They're alive!

00:09:57.790 --> 00:09:59.370
You don't know that.

00:09:59.370 --> 00:10:00.870
I do know it!

00:10:00.870 --> 00:10:04.160
Just so you know, not all demons
eat every person in sight!

00:10:04.160 --> 00:10:05.750
Enough, Kikka.

00:10:09.700 --> 00:10:12.290
This one won't be easy...

00:10:12.290 --> 00:10:15.950
But you're definitely participating
in the stage this time.

00:10:15.950 --> 00:10:16.830
Huh?

00:10:16.830 --> 00:10:19.750
Didn't you promise to
before the nurturing game?

00:10:19.750 --> 00:10:24.200
Sorry, but I'm going to sit
this one out. Maybe next time.

00:10:24.200 --> 00:10:25.700
You remember that?

00:10:25.700 --> 00:10:27.500
'Course I do.

00:10:27.500 --> 00:10:31.410
Then I guess the first players
this time are Kai... and Zak?

00:10:31.410 --> 00:10:33.120
Huh? Why me?

00:10:33.120 --> 00:10:37.370
You two have been getting along lately.
You always vanish together.

00:10:38.450 --> 00:10:41.040
Not that I care, but...

00:10:41.040 --> 00:10:43.450
It doesn't matter to me either.

00:10:43.450 --> 00:10:47.160
All right, then we need two more.
Are there any volunteers?

00:10:48.540 --> 00:10:50.120
I thought as much.

00:10:50.120 --> 00:10:52.750
But it's going to be all guys at this rate.

00:10:52.750 --> 00:10:56.040
Don't the demons
abduct girls? Will this work?

00:10:57.950 --> 00:11:00.870
Yeah, it looks great on you...

00:11:00.870 --> 00:11:03.250
I cannot allow it.

00:11:03.250 --> 00:11:07.160
According to the ancient scrolls
passed down for generations,

00:11:07.160 --> 00:11:12.910
the demons love bouncy, busty bodies,
or so the legends say.

00:11:19.040 --> 00:11:22.000
What're you making it
sound so dignified for?!

00:11:22.000 --> 00:11:24.000
G-Grandpa!

00:11:24.000 --> 00:11:26.870
Ah, man! Occult girl, you go!

00:11:26.870 --> 00:11:31.410
Huh? No way! You've got to be kidding
if you think I'm in after hearing all that!

00:11:31.410 --> 00:11:34.750
What?! It's about time you
participate in something, too!

00:11:34.750 --> 00:11:37.700
No! You stick on some meat buns and do it!

00:11:37.700 --> 00:11:39.330
Who would wear those?!

00:11:39.330 --> 00:11:43.000
Um, you might burn yourself
unless you wrap them first...

00:11:43.000 --> 00:11:46.160
Not doing it! Keep your
dumb advice to yourself!

00:11:46.160 --> 00:11:48.790
Hold on. Kudou has a vile face.

00:11:48.790 --> 00:11:50.750
Won't he just upset the demons instead of--

00:11:50.750 --> 00:11:54.290
Let's take this outside, jerk!
How about you be the sacrifice?!

00:11:54.290 --> 00:11:57.080
Good idea! Zak will look good in girl clothes!

00:11:57.080 --> 00:11:59.160
That's one thing I won't do.

00:11:59.160 --> 00:12:01.200
--You'll look good!
--I won't.

00:12:01.200 --> 00:12:04.540
And if you try to force me,
I'll cut my tongue off right here.

00:12:04.540 --> 00:12:05.830
O-Oh...

00:12:05.830 --> 00:12:09.660
I've never seen Oshigiri
this stubborn before...

00:12:09.660 --> 00:12:13.120
Then, Kai? Think you could
take one for the team?

00:12:13.120 --> 00:12:17.120
No thanks. Someone of my stature
won't seem like a girl anyway.

00:12:17.120 --> 00:12:21.950
"Sushi"
Just say you kinda stretched out
after hanging on a pole all night.

00:12:21.950 --> 00:12:23.330
"Sushi"
No thanks.

00:12:23.330 --> 00:12:25.290
Jeez, you're a selfish prick.

00:12:25.290 --> 00:12:27.870
I really don't want to hear it from you.

00:12:27.870 --> 00:12:29.120
Say what now?!

00:12:29.120 --> 00:12:30.250
--Guys, could we please calm down?

00:12:30.250 --> 00:12:32.200
--You know what your problem is?!
--Guys, could we please calm down?

00:12:32.200 --> 00:12:34.080
--In any case, I'm not doing it!
It's not happening! Never!

00:12:34.080 --> 00:12:36.750
--In any case, I'm not doing it!
It's not happening! Never!
--You're so full of yourself, it ain't funny!

00:12:36.750 --> 00:12:37.500
--I'm telling you, no means no!
--You're so full of yourself, it ain't funny!

00:12:37.500 --> 00:12:40.620
--I'm telling you, no means no!
--C-Calm down! Ah!

00:12:48.160 --> 00:12:50.120
Have we calmed down now?

00:12:50.120 --> 00:12:51.250
Yes.

00:12:51.250 --> 00:12:54.370
W-We're up against cheat-level monsters.

00:12:54.370 --> 00:12:57.290
We have to unite and
do this without fighting!

00:12:57.290 --> 00:13:00.500
I know! I've got a good idea, meow!

00:13:19.040 --> 00:13:20.450
Why Aikawa though?

00:13:20.450 --> 00:13:22.500
I guess you haven't heard, Zak.

00:13:22.500 --> 00:13:27.620
Looking into Makimaki's eyes enchants
anyone, regardless of age or gender.

00:13:27.620 --> 00:13:31.750
We'll use our cheat on the cheats.
Those demons are done for.

00:13:31.750 --> 00:13:33.120
Seriously?

00:13:33.120 --> 00:13:34.750
Want to try it?

00:13:53.290 --> 00:13:55.790
Enough. I feel strange...

00:13:55.790 --> 00:13:58.750
Awesome! But scary!

00:13:58.750 --> 00:14:01.330
What in the world are they doing?

00:14:03.290 --> 00:14:06.910
Got it? You're not to speak
a single word, Akki.

00:14:06.910 --> 00:14:09.040
They'll find out you're a guy.

00:14:09.040 --> 00:14:09.870
Okay!

00:14:09.870 --> 00:14:12.450
If you really have to, speak in falsetto.

00:14:12.450 --> 00:14:15.000
Give it a try, just like I taught you.

00:14:15.000 --> 00:14:17.200
Hi! I'm Akki!

00:14:20.000 --> 00:14:20.870
"Pfft!"

00:14:21.160 --> 00:14:24.620
She's totally screwing
with you, you know that?!

00:14:24.620 --> 00:14:26.450
Um...

00:14:26.450 --> 00:14:29.160
There's something that's been on my mind...

00:14:29.160 --> 00:14:33.750
Did you two make up after
your fight? That's great!

00:14:33.750 --> 00:14:36.000
We never fought from the start...

00:14:36.000 --> 00:14:39.200
--Huh?
--I'm saying we didn't fight!

00:14:40.410 --> 00:14:46.370
Anya ran out of medicine recently and
hadn't been able to get much sleep.

00:14:46.370 --> 00:14:50.500
But he didn't want to ask
Paka for some, so I...

00:14:56.000 --> 00:14:59.620
I told you I didn't want 'em!
Don't do shit on your own!

00:15:09.120 --> 00:15:10.620
So that's how it was...

00:15:10.620 --> 00:15:12.950
That's no reason to hit him though.

00:15:12.950 --> 00:15:14.290
Would you shut up?

00:15:14.290 --> 00:15:16.290
Can't you see he was worried about you?

00:15:16.290 --> 00:15:20.330
Pfft! I don't wanna hear it
from you, berserk girl!

00:15:32.330 --> 00:15:35.620
My feet... have gone numb.

00:15:35.620 --> 00:15:38.290
Will they really come out tonight?

00:15:39.410 --> 00:15:41.660
They'll come.

00:15:41.660 --> 00:15:43.830
They're already here.

00:15:47.620 --> 00:15:51.500
You foolish humans.
You fell straight into the trap.

00:15:51.500 --> 00:15:55.660
You sealed your fate coming
to Kakuriyo, the village of demons.

00:15:55.660 --> 00:15:58.000
You won't be leaving alive.

00:15:58.000 --> 00:16:00.330
Especially this one...

00:16:00.330 --> 00:16:03.040
You sure got me good earlier, didn't you?

00:16:03.040 --> 00:16:07.370
I'll make you regret ever
standing up to the great Kikka.

00:16:10.500 --> 00:16:13.120
What is it, Missy? Something wrong?

00:16:13.120 --> 00:16:14.750
U-Um...

00:16:16.790 --> 00:16:19.660
Th-There's a bug crawling on your back.

00:16:19.660 --> 00:16:21.620
A bug?

00:16:21.620 --> 00:16:23.450
Take it away, Oshigiri.

00:16:23.450 --> 00:16:28.250
There's a 2 cm caterpillar climbing
on your right shoulder blade.

00:16:28.250 --> 00:16:30.160
It's almost to your nape.

00:16:30.160 --> 00:16:32.750
I didn't ask for that sort of commentary.

00:16:32.750 --> 00:16:34.870
I don't like squishy bugs.

00:16:36.370 --> 00:16:40.660
So cute... It's so tiny and plump!

00:16:40.660 --> 00:16:42.700
Afraid of bugs? You sissy.

00:16:42.700 --> 00:16:46.620
Anboy, there's a Hercules beetle
hanging out on your back.

00:16:46.620 --> 00:16:48.160
Seriously? Get it!

00:16:48.160 --> 00:16:50.080
It's the world's biggest!

00:16:50.080 --> 00:16:52.910
Would you both shut up?! Be quiet!

00:17:04.750 --> 00:17:07.870
Are these tonight's sacrifices?

00:17:16.580 --> 00:17:18.250
Change them!

00:17:19.540 --> 00:17:20.450
What...

00:17:20.450 --> 00:17:21.950
...was that?

00:17:21.950 --> 00:17:23.040
Huh?

00:17:23.040 --> 00:17:26.410
Your bodies are not bouncy or busty at all!

00:17:26.410 --> 00:17:29.660
They're thin and frail like matchsticks!

00:17:29.660 --> 00:17:31.910
I'm honestly, you know...

00:17:31.910 --> 00:17:35.790
Naked, I'm... um... you know.

00:17:35.790 --> 00:17:37.700
Don't push your luck, man!

00:17:37.700 --> 00:17:40.580
But we've still got Makimaki's stare attack!

00:17:42.290 --> 00:17:44.750
Wake up, Makimaki!

00:17:44.750 --> 00:17:47.950
Enough chitchat. Bring out the women!

00:17:52.410 --> 00:17:55.000
You better cut this shit out!

00:17:55.000 --> 00:17:59.910
So that's where you were.
Which one will it be, Kikka?

00:17:59.910 --> 00:18:02.370
This one! I want this one, Grandpa!

00:18:02.370 --> 00:18:04.750
She seems the softest of them all.

00:18:04.750 --> 00:18:06.700
Grandpa?

00:18:06.700 --> 00:18:10.200
Is he that bearded grandpa man?!

00:18:10.200 --> 00:18:13.290
Okay, okay. Let's go with her then.

00:18:13.290 --> 00:18:17.450
Hey, can't we take more than one?

00:18:17.450 --> 00:18:20.910
I really want that tiny one, too!

00:18:20.910 --> 00:18:26.080
I think that one over there looks
much bouncier and bust-- Ahem...

00:18:26.080 --> 00:18:27.950
Um, don't you agree?

00:18:27.950 --> 00:18:30.700
No way. She seems scary.

00:18:30.700 --> 00:18:35.620
I see... Either way, the dungeon
is packed to the brim.

00:18:35.620 --> 00:18:40.120
If you want another,
you'll have to get rid of one first.

00:18:40.120 --> 00:18:41.870
Tsk! Fine...

00:18:44.910 --> 00:18:48.080
Um, could I come with you, too?

00:18:48.080 --> 00:18:52.540
Nope! I'd have to dispose
of someone, so I don't need you.

00:18:52.540 --> 00:18:55.870
Oh, don't say that. It'll be like a trial.

00:18:55.870 --> 00:18:57.870
If you don't need me, get rid of me.

00:18:57.870 --> 00:19:00.080
Akatsuki! What the hell are you think--

00:19:00.080 --> 00:19:03.250
It's Karin.

00:19:03.250 --> 00:19:05.950
I can't let Karin be by herself.

00:19:13.620 --> 00:19:16.700
Please, Elder Kihachi!

00:19:19.790 --> 00:19:22.200
Very well.

00:19:27.620 --> 00:19:28.750
Dammit, Dimwitsuki!

00:19:28.750 --> 00:19:30.330
Calm down, Anboy.

00:19:30.330 --> 00:19:32.750
How the hell can I stay calm?!

00:19:32.750 --> 00:19:35.500
He just doesn't understand!

00:19:52.830 --> 00:19:54.080
Tsk.

00:19:54.080 --> 00:19:55.790
Don't come in.

00:19:59.950 --> 00:20:03.870
Anya, I only get D's in Phys Ed.

00:20:06.790 --> 00:20:09.950
If you happen to collapse again,

00:20:09.950 --> 00:20:13.450
I might not be able to carry you to safety.

00:20:16.000 --> 00:20:17.830
I...

00:20:17.830 --> 00:20:20.870
I want to finish this with everybody.

00:20:20.870 --> 00:20:23.580
I'll be upset if you're not there.

00:20:37.870 --> 00:20:41.540
I'm leaving your medicine right here.

00:20:41.540 --> 00:20:43.410
I'll be waiting outside.

00:20:58.080 --> 00:21:02.450
Um, it's raining harder than I thought,
so can I wait in here?

00:21:02.450 --> 00:21:05.000
You know what?!

00:21:05.000 --> 00:21:07.000
You really are...!

00:21:08.870 --> 00:21:10.330
Sheesh...

00:21:39.080 --> 00:21:43.120
When you say everyone, that includes you...

00:21:46.450 --> 00:21:51.250
It's okay. The players have changed,
but it's still going according to plan.

00:21:51.250 --> 00:21:54.040
What part of it? We've got
no idea where they are.

00:21:54.040 --> 00:21:57.870
We do. You know the card Akki
always hangs from his neck?

00:21:57.870 --> 00:22:01.000
I put a transmitter on it.

00:22:01.000 --> 00:22:03.250
We'll chase them wherever they go.

00:22:04.750 --> 00:22:07.290
We won't lose them.

00:22:07.290 --> 00:22:08.750
Not a chance.
